// HZM coop - HEADSHOT KILL cue. Played to the killing player (CHAN_LOCAL) by the engine when a player
// kills an enemy AI with a head/helmet/neck hit (openmohaa-hzm weaputils.cpp BulletAttack). Any
// ubersound/*.scr is auto-registered. Source: sound-browser/headshot_0.mp3 -> wav (no OGG/MP3 SFX codec).
alias coop_headshot sound/coop_headshot/headshot.wav soundparms 2.5 0 1.0 0 100 10000 local loaded maps "m e t dm obj train"
